OL,3,GNEWSABurnham defends Jackdaw decision
OL,4,Aas Badenoch urges PM to overturn ban on
OL,5,Anew oil and gas licences
OL,6,
OL,7,FConservative leader Kemi Badenoch
OL,8,Faccused the prime minister of
OL,9,F"dithering" on Jackdaw and said a ban
OL,10,Fon new oil and gas licences should be
OL,11,Frepealed - but Andy Burnham said her
OL,12,Fparty had "messed up" the original
OL,13,Fdecision.
